# (2026-08-20) Deterministic line endings — one rule set for every clone.
#
# Windows `core.autocrlf=true` plans a LF→CRLF conversion for every text
# file it touches, which prints "warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF" for
# every LF working file (the Cargo/tauri/npm manifests are regenerated
# with LF by their tools). Pinning `eol=lf` for text makes the repo AND
# the working tree LF on every platform: no conversions, no warnings,
# byte-stable diffs. Existing checkouts stay clean (git compares both
# sides normalized); only future checkouts come out LF.
#
# Binaries are pinned explicitly so no attribute mistake can ever route
# them through the text filters.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── Binaries ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.bin binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.lnk binary
*.zip binary
